000100 IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.
000200 PROGRAM-ID. ROLS6021.
000300 ENVIRONMENT DIVISION.
000400 INPUT-OUTPUT SECTION.
000500 FILE-CONTROL.
000600     SELECT PRODUCT-FILE ASSIGN TO "data/products.dat"
000700       ORGANIZATION IS SEQUENTIAL.
000800 DATA DIVISION.
000900 FILE SECTION.
001000 FD PRODUCT-FILE.
001100 01 PRODUCT-FILE-REC.
001200    05 F-PRD-ID PIC 9(6).
001300    05 F-PRD-NAME PIC X(30).
001400    05 F-PRD-PRICE PIC 9(7)V99.
001500    05 F-PRD-STOCK PIC 9(7).
001600 WORKING-STORAGE SECTION.
001700 COPY CPM-PRODUCT.
001800 01 WS-EOF PIC X VALUE SPACE.
001900 01 WS-MAX-ID PIC 9(6) VALUE 0.
002000 PROCEDURE DIVISION.
002100 MAIN.
002200     ACCEPT PRD-NAME
002300     ACCEPT PRD-PRICE
002400     ACCEPT PRD-STOCK
002500     PERFORM ASSIGN-NEXT-ID
002600     MOVE PRD-ID TO F-PRD-ID
002700     MOVE PRD-NAME TO F-PRD-NAME
002800     MOVE PRD-PRICE TO F-PRD-PRICE
002900     MOVE PRD-STOCK TO F-PRD-STOCK
003000     OPEN EXTEND PRODUCT-FILE
003100     WRITE PRODUCT-FILE-REC
003200     CLOSE PRODUCT-FILE
003300     DISPLAY "OK PRODUCT STORED ID " PRD-ID
003400     EXIT PROGRAM.
003500 ASSIGN-NEXT-ID.
003600     MOVE 0 TO WS-MAX-ID
003700     MOVE SPACE TO WS-EOF
003800     OPEN INPUT PRODUCT-FILE
003900     PERFORM UNTIL WS-EOF = 'Y'
004000       READ PRODUCT-FILE
004100         AT END MOVE 'Y' TO WS-EOF
004200         NOT AT END
004300           IF F-PRD-ID > WS-MAX-ID
004400              MOVE F-PRD-ID TO WS-MAX-ID
004500           END-IF
004600       END-READ
004700     END-PERFORM
004800     CLOSE PRODUCT-FILE
004900     ADD 1 TO WS-MAX-ID
005000     MOVE WS-MAX-ID TO PRD-ID.
